  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Этот ресурспак еще не завершен.<br><span style=\"color:#fff\">Создан для</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/nekoropolia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nekoro Pokemon</a></span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">модпака.<br>Попробуйте его вместе с </span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/nekoro-f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nekoro Font</a>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">и <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/nekoro-eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nekoro Enchanted Books</a></span>. <br>Протестирован только на версии Minecraft 1.21.1.</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">Возможно, я сделаю версию в других цветах, но сначала мне нужно улучшить текущий вид.<br><br>Этот ресурспак изменяет интерфейс и HUD на:<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchanting Infuser</a></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">-<span style=\"color:#3598db\">Just Enough Items</span>&nbsp;</span></a></span><br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jobs+</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legendary-survival-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legendary Survival Overhaul</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nutritional-balance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nutritional Balance</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projecte\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProjectE</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></span>&nbsp;<br>-<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ultimine-addition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Ultimine Addition</a></span>&nbsp;<br><br></span><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fnekoropolia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/975384/description_8a33147a-1e7a-41f5-8660-d16dbf7857fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></a></span></span></p>",
